'''Hippoe''' (カバちゃん, ''Kaba-chan'', '''Hippo-chan''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hippoe
|image = E 003.png
|first appearance = '''EoC''': [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Chapter 1 - Japan/Fukuoka]]<br>
'''ItF''': [[Korea (Into the Future)|Chapter 1 - Korea]]<br>
'''SoL''': [[Sleeping Lion|Sub-chapter 1 - Sleeping Lion]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Undertow Coast|Sub-chapter 6 - Undertow Coast]]
|money drop = 400¢ - 1,580¢
}}

==Enemy==
Hippoe is the first "boss" enemy the player will encounter. They are similar to [[Those Guys]] with Area Attack, five times the health and damage of Those Guys, but a slower attack rate and speed.

==Strategy==
Hippoe is a very strong enemy early on, being able to withstand multiple hits from Gross Cat. It will take about 10 hits from [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] to destroy Hippoe in their [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|debut stage]]. Most of the time, you will need to abuse Hippoe's short range by stalling them with meatshields like [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] while your ranged attackers whittle them down, and optionally clear any peons near them.

In later stages, Hippoe is essentially a money bag that dies in very few hits to your attackers unless insanely buffed, such as in [[The Noble Tribe]].

